# Optional: 32-byte Ethereum private key (hex format with 0x prefix) for the agent wallet.
# Format reference only: npm start does not automatically load .env files.
# Inject AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY through your runtime's secret manager.
# If omitted, a persistent wallet is saved to .agent-wallet.json (0600) and reused.
# AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY=0x0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef
